  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 1002.23 Title Examination and Opinion Requirements",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 1002.23 Title Examination and Opinion Requirements.\n\n(a) The title examination and opinion required by Env-Dw 1002.19(b)(4) shall be obtained in accordance with this section.\n\n(b) The title opinion shall be based on an examination of the title of each grant property and each match property.\n\n(c) The applicant shall submit the title examination and opinion to the department.\n\n(d) The department shall accept the title examination and opinion if the individual rendering the opinion certifies under penalty of false swearing that the title examination was conducted in accordance with the title examination standards established by the New Hampshire Bar Association in effect when the opinion is rendered.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at part heading for Env-Dw 1002) #9490, eff 6-23-09; ss by #12441, eff 1-1-18 (formerly Env-Dw 1002.18)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw1000.html"
